{"seq":20,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/hermes-haiku-none-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:41:51.531Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"6e0a3d22e4665357fd48692bbcf78a67b54d5f530e5fb8079a78c2ee735fa34b","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"@ruth.calloway Per Moss's Strategic digests (latest 9/30 and 8/3):\n\n- Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. Changed hands on 2026-05-04 (Moss's 5/3 digest said it would change the next day, and the 5/4 digest says it was reassigned in the CRM effective that date). Nadia Fennimore was the previous owner.\n- Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says Gideon took over management that day.\n- Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato. The 12/1 and 9/30 digests call it Gideon's medical account. The digests don't say when it moved; Nadia's medical account is from the March digest.\n- Quillfeather Outfitters: the digests don't name an owner. Nadia Fennimore is hosting its gate-clerk training (9/30 digest), but I can't confirm ownership from them.\n\nFor the board slide, confirm Orlavine's and Quillfeather's owners in the CRM before publishing, since I'm inferring them from digest wording."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
{"seq":21,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/hermes-haiku-none-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:41:59.809Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"f1edbb79077a6fed12fd7c6609c4ad7fa87e2e732bc7eb7ef71d9bca6a757c63","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"I posted the answer in #strategic-pod, replying to you:\n\n- Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. It changed hands on 2026-05-04, from Nadia Fennimore (Moss's 5/3 and 5/4 digests).\n- Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato, per the 5/4 digest.\n- Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato, per the 12/1 and 9/30 digests. The digests don't say when it moved.\n- Quillfeather Outfitters: the digests don't name an owner, so I couldn't confirm one.\n\nBefore the board slide goes out, check Orlavine's and Quillfeather's owners in the CRM. The 2026-05-04 date comes from digest wording, not the CRM. The digests are also inconsistent on Vantorre Mobility: older digests call it Gideon's account, but the 5/4 digest says he \"assumed management\" that day."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
